// woodcore:object heading title
== Prestressing
// woodcore:/object title

// woodcore:object text p1
In prestressed members, subsequent openings are possible only to a very limited extent, after consultation with the engineer and taking account of the position of the tendons. The anchorages are marked on the underside of the floors. Fixings for equipment are likewise subject to the engineer's approval.
// woodcore:/object p1
